=== trackers, in full (reads GitHub)
$ sh <skills>/trackers/scripts/tracker-read.sh --url https://example.com/page
    tracker-read.sh: not a tracker link: example.com/page
    [exit 3]
    first line: # interactive pr list
$ sh <skills>/trackers/scripts/context-add-ticket.sh --effort <S>/space/efforts/<id>-installed --url https://github.com/cli/cli/issues/1
